    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d636">

                <pb facs="1050" n="954" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg954"/>

                <head>No. 634.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 19,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Correspondence sent to London on the 16th is due there to-morrow. It includes
                    several telegrams which you may desire to have repeated; also the Spanish text
                    of the reply to our protest, which I hope you will order cabled in the original,
                    as it will best show the temper of this government.</p>
                <closer><signed>SICKLES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
